Bootstrap: docker
From: python:3.12-slim

%labels
    Software Python 3.12 (Debian slim) + awk/coreutils/findutils
    Version 3.12

%help
    Generic image for the host-side steps of msi_detection: python3 (standard
    library only) for msi_detection_main_p.py and msi_detection_report_p.py,
    given to the tasks as WDL Files (NOT in the image; msi_detection_pre_p.py
    and msi_detection_post_p.py run in it from main-scripts/), and awk/find/sort for the bash
    tasks. No pipeline code here: changing the script needs no rebuild.

    Usage:
        apptainer exec python-MSI-3.12.sif python3 script.py ...
        apptainer exec python-MSI-3.12.sif awk '...' file

%environment
    export LC_ALL=C.UTF-8

%test
    set -e
    python3 --version
    awk 'BEGIN { print "awk ok" }'
    find --version | head -1
    sort --version | head -1
    realpath --version | head -1
